# --- Generators / converters ---
tooltip.rfgen.rf_generator.summary=Free energy: 100,000 RF/t into neighbors
tooltip.rfgen.rf_generator.detail.1=Buffer 10,000,000 RF. Extract up to 100,000 RF/t.
tooltip.rfgen.rf_generator.detail.2=No fuel. Pushes Forge Energy to adjacent machines.
tooltip.rfgen.rf_generator.detail.3=Permanent — does not expire or convert.

tooltip.rfgen.unstable_wormhole_energy_converter.summary=10,000 RF/t for 1 hour, then Unstable Naquadah
tooltip.rfgen.unstable_wormhole_energy_converter.detail.1=Buffer 1,000,000 RF. Extract up to 10,000 RF/t.
tooltip.rfgen.unstable_wormhole_energy_converter.detail.2=Lifetime: 72,000 ticks (~60 minutes at 20 TPS).
tooltip.rfgen.unstable_wormhole_energy_converter.detail.3=When time runs out, becomes Unstable Block of Naquadah.

tooltip.rfgen.naquadah_generator.summary=5,000 RF/t for 10 minutes, then Unstable Naquadah
tooltip.rfgen.naquadah_generator.detail.1=Buffer 500,000 RF. Extract up to 5,000 RF/t.
tooltip.rfgen.naquadah_generator.detail.2=Lifetime: 12,000 ticks (~10 minutes at 20 TPS).
tooltip.rfgen.naquadah_generator.detail.3=When time runs out, becomes Unstable Block of Naquadah.

# --- World / drops ---
tooltip.rfgen.naquadah_ore.summary=25% chance to drop Raw Naquadah when mined
tooltip.rfgen.naquadah_ore.detail.1=25% chance to drop 1 Raw Naquadah when mined by a player.
tooltip.rfgen.naquadah_ore.detail.2=Silk Touch suppresses the special drop.
tooltip.rfgen.naquadah_ore.detail.3=Crafted from stone, quartz, and obsidian — then mine it for Raw Naquadah.

tooltip.rfgen.unstable_naquadah_block.summary=Mines into 4 Unstable Naquadah
tooltip.rfgen.unstable_naquadah_block.detail.1=Dropped by expired generators and the Unstable Duplicator.
tooltip.rfgen.unstable_naquadah_block.detail.2=Player harvest (no Silk Touch) yields 4 Unstable Naquadah.

tooltip.rfgen.raw_naquadah.summary=Mine Synthetic Naquadah Ore (25% drop), then blow it up to refine
tooltip.rfgen.raw_naquadah.detail.1=Obtain: craft Synthetic Naquadah Ore, place it, then mine it (25% chance per block).
tooltip.rfgen.raw_naquadah.detail.2=Silk Touch on the ore skips the Raw Naquadah drop.
tooltip.rfgen.raw_naquadah.detail.3=Refine: drop Raw Naquadah as an item and detonate nearby (TNT, etc.) → Refined 1:1.

tooltip.rfgen.refined_naquadah.summary=Core crafting material for Wormhole tech
tooltip.rfgen.refined_naquadah.detail.1=Also craftable from Unstable Naquadah + blaze powder.
tooltip.rfgen.refined_naquadah.detail.2=Used in Quantum Glue, reactors, and machines.

tooltip.rfgen.unstable_naquadah.summary=Byproduct of unstable machines and blocks
tooltip.rfgen.unstable_naquadah.detail.1=Craft into Refined Naquadah or Synthetic Mineral.
tooltip.rfgen.unstable_naquadah.detail.2=Comes from mining Unstable Block of Naquadah (×4).

